{"name":"Saddle Brown","hex":"#8b4513","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"saddle brown","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A medium brown colour, like that of a saddle."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a medium brown colour, like that of a saddle."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/saddle_brown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Saddle","blocks":[{"text":"A saddle is a supportive structure for a rider of an animal, fastened to an animal's back by a girth. The most common type is equestrian. However, specialized saddles have been created for oxen, camels and other animals. The trade of making saddles is saddlery."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Saddle_with_shabrack_according_to_tradition_linked_with_Hetman_Miko%C5%82aj_Hieronim_Sieniawski.jpg/330px-Saddle_with_shabrack_according_to_tradition_linked_with_Hetman_Miko%C5%82aj_Hieronim_Sieniawski.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saddle"},{"title":"Brown","blocks":[{"text":"Brown is a color. It can be thought as a darker, typically desaturated shade of orange, and can often be produced by combining red and yellow with another color, namely blue."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/StubbenTristan.jpg/500px-StubbenTristan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/StubbenTristan.jpg/1280px-StubbenTristan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/StubbenTristan.jpg/500px-StubbenTristan